WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.214 --> 00:00:01.723
- That's like the weirdest
thing that I've ever seen.

00:00:01.723 --> 00:00:02.700
(suctioned glass popping)

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.590
(astonished gasps and laughs)

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:08.772
(funky upbeat jazz)

00:00:11.182 --> 00:00:14.465
- Fire cupping therapy is an
ancient practice that uses

00:00:14.465 --> 00:00:16.956
localized pressure to promote healing

00:00:16.956 --> 00:00:19.394
and to reduce pain in the body.

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:20.960
- Is it gonna burn at all?

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.400
Like do you set the cup on fire?

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.602
- I light a piece of cotton
ball on fire and I stick it

00:00:25.602 --> 00:00:27.993
into the cup to combust the oxygen.

00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:29.071
But it doesn't burn

00:00:29.071 --> 00:00:31.308
so the fire isn't directly touching.
(laughter)

00:00:31.308 --> 00:00:33.568
You might feel the heat from the rim

00:00:33.568 --> 00:00:35.286
of the glass cup but that's about it.

00:00:35.286 --> 00:00:37.451
- I've seen people after
they've gotten cupping

00:00:37.451 --> 00:00:39.889
and they have these big
circles on their back

00:00:39.889 --> 00:00:41.433
and it looks kind of bruised.

00:00:41.433 --> 00:00:42.745
- You can think of it almost like a hickey

00:00:42.745 --> 00:00:46.460
so it's the breaking of
the blood capillaries.

00:00:46.726 --> 00:00:48.245
- How much squealing do you usually hear

00:00:48.245 --> 00:00:49.964
when you perform this on people?

00:00:49.964 --> 00:00:50.776
- [Sonya] Rarely.

00:00:50.776 --> 00:00:51.644
- Rarely squeals?

00:00:51.644 --> 00:00:53.821
- Unless you want the cup super strong.

00:00:53.821 --> 00:00:55.388
I mean, if you're looking to experience

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.109
pain we could do that.
(laughter)

00:00:57.979 --> 00:00:58.970
- I'm excited.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.565
- I'm frightened.

00:01:02.235 --> 00:01:04.488
- I'm really excited
about getting this done.

00:01:04.488 --> 00:01:05.862
Sonya was saying about how it's like

00:01:05.862 --> 00:01:09.414
a reverse massage so I think
it's gonna be really cool.

00:01:10.044 --> 00:01:12.853
- So first I douse a
cotton ball in alcohol.

00:01:14.593 --> 00:01:16.301
And light it on fire.
(lighter clicks)

00:01:16.861 --> 00:01:18.239
It's creating a torch.

00:01:18.239 --> 00:01:21.005
You stick the fire inside of the glass.

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:23.893
- Oooh (laughs).

00:01:26.019 --> 00:01:27.742
It doesn't hurt though guys.

00:01:31.150 --> 00:01:32.643
(laughter)

00:01:32.643 --> 00:01:34.603
